1
00:01:26,319 --> 00:01:27,319
It's dropping! It's dropping!

2
00:01:27,359 --> 00:01:30,120
The market is tanking! What do we do?!

3
00:01:30,319 --> 00:01:31,319
Oh, good Lord!

4
00:01:31,319 --> 00:01:33,200
It's in freefall, Dawei!

5
00:01:33,439 --> 00:01:34,519
Aren't we going to sell?!

6
00:01:34,640 --> 00:01:36,200
I hear you. I hear you.

7
00:01:36,560 --> 00:01:38,120
Stay calm. Don't panic.

8
00:01:38,200 --> 00:01:38,920
Hold steady.

9
00:01:40,120 --> 00:01:41,280
How can I stay calm?!

10
00:01:41,280 --> 00:01:42,079
What are we going to do?!

11
00:01:42,079 --> 00:01:43,439
That's real money right there!

12
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:46,359
For this batch of goods going to Yunding,

13
00:01:46,760 --> 00:01:48,599
the wiring must be reinforced once more.

14
00:01:48,920 --> 00:01:50,439
If anyone produces defective goods,

15
00:01:50,439 --> 00:01:51,680
I'm docking their bonus.

16
00:01:51,920 --> 00:01:53,239
Don't worry, Mr. Ma! Don't worry!

17
00:01:55,959 --> 00:01:56,680
Also,

18
00:01:56,920 --> 00:01:58,280
I've got some great news for everyone.

19
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:01,400
I had Director Dong secure the empty lot.

20
00:02:01,719 --> 00:02:03,400
We'll build a new workshop right there,

21
00:02:03,480 --> 00:02:05,239
switch to fully imported assembly lines,

22
00:02:05,319 --> 00:02:06,079
and expand our operations!

23
00:02:06,079 --> 00:02:08,479
Great! Great!

24
00:02:08,919 --> 00:02:10,840
As long as you all work hard with me,

25
00:02:11,240 --> 00:02:11,840
by the end of the year,

26
00:02:12,039 --> 00:02:14,719
you'll happily count cash this New Year!

27
00:02:15,120 --> 00:02:16,240
Yeah!

28
00:02:16,319 --> 00:02:17,680
Follow Mr. Ma! Follow Mr. Ma!

29
00:02:17,800 --> 00:02:18,919
Follow Mr. Ma!

30
00:02:19,080 --> 00:02:20,199
Follow Mr. Ma!

31
00:02:20,520 --> 00:02:21,639
Follow Mr. Ma!

32
00:02:22,039 --> 00:02:23,080
Follow Mr. Ma!

33
00:02:23,560 --> 00:02:25,520
Follow Mr. Ma!

34
00:02:25,520 --> 00:02:25,879
Hello?

35
00:02:25,879 --> 00:02:26,439
Sister-in-law.

36
00:02:27,080 --> 00:02:27,800
Dawei,

37
00:02:28,159 --> 00:02:29,840
it hit the limit up. Can we sell now?

38
00:02:30,199 --> 00:02:31,159
Let's lock in our profits!

39
00:02:31,680 --> 00:02:32,199
Don't sell!

40
00:02:32,199 --> 00:02:32,960
Absolutely do not sell!

41
00:02:33,280 --> 00:02:34,000
By the way, Sister-in-law,

42
00:02:34,400 --> 00:02:35,479
that Sichuan Changhong stock,

43
00:02:35,479 --> 00:02:36,560
did you buy the dip like I asked?

44
00:02:36,840 --> 00:02:38,360
Bought it, bought it—fried it up!

45
00:02:38,719 --> 00:02:39,319
No, wait.

46
00:02:39,360 --> 00:02:40,199
I bought the dip!

47
00:02:40,479 --> 00:02:42,400
Put all the remaining 20 million into it!

48
00:02:42,680 --> 00:02:43,280
Dawei,

49
00:02:43,639 --> 00:02:44,800
are we really not selling?

50
00:02:44,919 --> 00:02:46,879
Hold steady. Keep a full position.

51
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:47,879
Don't sell, no matter what!

52
00:02:48,080 --> 00:02:49,319
Is it really that intense?

53
00:02:50,719 --> 00:02:51,400
Hui'er!

54
00:02:51,919 --> 00:02:53,360
What are you shouting about?

55
00:02:53,960 --> 00:02:55,599
Talking about frying things and buying dips...

56
00:02:55,840 --> 00:02:57,360
What on earth are you frying in that pot?

57
00:02:57,360 --> 00:02:59,599
Dad, I'm not talking about cooking!

58
00:02:59,800 --> 00:03:01,560
We're trading stocks and making big money!

59
00:03:01,719 --> 00:03:02,360
Trading stocks?

60
00:03:02,479 --> 00:03:03,319
How much did you make, then?

61
00:03:04,039 --> 00:03:04,960
It topped this number.

62
00:03:05,199 --> 00:03:06,000
100 million?

63
00:03:06,759 --> 00:03:07,319
How much?!

64
00:03:07,840 --> 00:03:08,599
100 million!

65
00:03:09,039 --> 00:03:09,759
100 million?

66
00:03:09,840 --> 00:03:10,560
100 million!

67
00:03:11,639 --> 00:03:12,240
Dad!

68
00:03:12,520 --> 00:03:13,120
Dad!

69
00:03:14,520 --> 00:03:15,120
Dad!

70
00:03:15,319 --> 00:03:16,319
Hang in there, Dad!

71
00:03:17,120 --> 00:03:18,319
Follow Mr. Ma!

72
00:03:18,520 --> 00:03:19,759
Follow Mr. Ma!

73
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:21,159
Follow Mr. Ma!

74
00:03:21,360 --> 00:03:22,280
Follow Mr. Ma!

75
00:03:22,280 --> 00:03:23,680
I said absolutely do not sell!

76
00:03:23,800 --> 00:03:24,599
Don't sell, no matter what!

77
00:03:24,599 --> 00:03:25,879
Don't sell until it hits the peak!

78
00:03:25,960 --> 00:03:26,599
Dawei...

79
00:03:26,719 --> 00:03:27,960
Dad was so shocked he's in the hospital!

80
00:03:29,439 --> 00:03:30,520
Follow Mr. Ma!

81
00:03:30,879 --> 00:03:32,039
Follow Mr. Ma!

82
00:03:33,240 --> 00:03:33,719
Ones,

83
00:03:33,759 --> 00:03:34,360
tens,

84
00:03:34,639 --> 00:03:35,039
hundreds,

85
00:03:35,159 --> 00:03:35,759
thousands,

86
00:03:36,479 --> 00:03:36,840
ten thousands,

87
00:03:37,719 --> 00:03:38,800
hundred thousands,

88
00:03:39,599 --> 00:03:40,759
millions...

89
00:03:42,240 --> 00:03:43,439
That's so many zeros!

90
00:03:43,879 --> 00:03:46,039
Dad, you've got to hold it together!

91
00:03:46,439 --> 00:03:47,120
I'm fine.

92
00:03:47,439 --> 00:03:48,159
I've already...

93
00:03:48,439 --> 00:03:49,280
got... gotten used to it.

94
00:03:49,520 --> 00:03:50,400
Let me count again.

95
00:03:50,719 --> 00:03:51,639
Hundred thousands,

96
00:03:52,560 --> 00:03:53,159
millions,

97
00:03:53,840 --> 00:03:55,039
ten millions,

98
00:03:56,319 --> 00:03:57,520
hundred millions,

99
00:03:57,759 --> 00:03:59,800
billions...

100
00:04:01,080 --> 00:04:01,879
Ten...

101
00:04:02,520 --> 00:04:03,159
Ten...

102
00:04:04,800 --> 00:04:05,280
Nannan!

103
00:04:05,280 --> 00:04:05,960
Nannan!

104
00:04:06,759 --> 00:04:07,319
You'll get used to it.

105
00:04:07,639 --> 00:04:08,240
You'll get used to it.

106
00:04:08,439 --> 00:04:08,919
It's okay, it's okay.

107
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:09,840
You'll slowly get used to it.

108
00:04:22,639 --> 00:04:24,240
Have you guys ever thought about this?

109
00:04:25,879 --> 00:04:26,439
Thinking about...

110
00:04:26,439 --> 00:04:27,360
whether we should eat

111
00:04:27,360 --> 00:04:30,680
braised ribs or stewed ribs today?

112
00:04:31,639 --> 00:04:33,399
I've had such a huge shock,

113
00:04:33,399 --> 00:04:35,160
so I really need to treat myself today!

114
00:04:35,439 --> 00:04:36,319
Forget the ribs!

115
00:04:36,959 --> 00:04:38,079
Think about Jinhua Factory's future!

116
00:04:40,360 --> 00:04:40,920
Come on,

117
00:04:41,120 --> 00:04:41,800
everyone listen up.

118
00:04:43,160 --> 00:04:44,120
Even though Jinhua Factory

119
00:04:44,319 --> 00:04:45,759
made it into Yunding Department Store

120
00:04:46,120 --> 00:04:47,079
and sales are booming,

121
00:04:47,360 --> 00:04:49,600
our lifeline is in someone else's hands.

122
00:04:49,639 --> 00:04:51,439
Manager Sun and Zhou Qian failed this time,

123
00:04:51,759 --> 00:04:52,439
but next time,

124
00:04:52,639 --> 00:04:53,680
what if their executives say the word

125
00:04:53,759 --> 00:04:54,959
and have us by the throat again?

126
00:04:55,399 --> 00:04:56,240
No way.

127
00:04:57,040 --> 00:04:58,199
Our clothes are selling so well.

128
00:04:58,639 --> 00:04:59,920
Doesn't the mall make money too?

129
00:05:00,279 --> 00:05:00,839
Sister-in-law,

130
00:05:01,600 --> 00:05:03,079
in business, there are no permanent friends,

131
00:05:03,600 --> 00:05:05,120
only permanent interests.

132
00:05:08,759 --> 00:05:10,360
As the one running Jinhua,

133
00:05:10,879 --> 00:05:12,920
how could I let someone else hold the knife?

134
00:05:15,120 --> 00:05:15,800
So,

135
00:05:16,000 --> 00:05:16,879
I've made up my mind.

136
00:05:17,120 --> 00:05:19,360
We'll use our billion-plus stock profits

137
00:05:19,360 --> 00:05:20,759
and charge into the capital market.

138
00:05:21,199 --> 00:05:22,959
Taking Yunding will be a piece of cake.

139
00:05:24,199 --> 00:05:26,519
I don't want to just rent a mall counter

140
00:05:26,519 --> 00:05:27,600
and be at their mercy.

141
00:05:30,800 --> 00:05:34,279
I want a seat at Yunding's board table.

142
00:05:35,959 --> 00:05:36,439
That way,

143
00:05:36,920 --> 00:05:38,160
Jinhua's lifeline

144
00:05:38,160 --> 00:05:39,560
will truly be in our own hands.

145
00:05:40,079 --> 00:05:40,759
Besides,

146
00:05:41,000 --> 00:05:42,959
this is just the first step for my empire.

147
00:05:43,160 --> 00:05:44,959
Once I gain control of Yunding,

148
00:05:45,279 --> 00:05:45,959
in the future,

149
00:05:46,240 --> 00:05:47,639
the business world of Nancheng...

150
00:05:58,360 --> 00:05:58,920
Forget it.

151
00:06:00,319 --> 00:06:02,680
How can a sparrow understand a swan's ambition?

152
00:06:04,560 --> 00:06:05,360
Looks like

153
00:06:06,040 --> 00:06:07,560
when it comes to acquiring Yunding,

154
00:06:09,199 --> 00:06:11,519
I'm the only one quietly flexing.

155
00:06:20,759 --> 00:06:21,519
Sister-in-law,

156
00:06:21,759 --> 00:06:23,800
you'd better have Dad rest at the hospital.

157
00:06:23,920 --> 00:06:25,079
He doesn't need to worry about money.

158
00:06:25,360 --> 00:06:25,920
Trust me.

159
00:06:26,160 --> 00:06:27,519
Let the bullets fly for a bit.

160
00:06:27,639 --> 00:06:29,560
Limit ups are going to keep rolling in.

161
00:06:29,560 --> 00:06:31,639
Talking big about multiple limit ups, huh?

162
00:06:32,079 --> 00:06:33,800
Struck it rich lately, Boss Ma?

163
00:06:34,040 --> 00:06:35,160
Even dabbling in stocks now.

164
00:06:36,399 --> 00:06:37,199
Hey there, rich lady.

165
00:06:37,680 --> 00:06:38,480
What a coincidence again.

166
00:06:38,920 --> 00:06:41,759
Did you buy that tight black vest already,

167
00:06:41,759 --> 00:06:44,079
ready to throw yourself at Chairman Shen?

168
00:06:44,959 --> 00:06:46,680
What are you spouting in broad daylight?

169
00:06:47,199 --> 00:06:49,120
I have real business with Chairman Shen.

170
00:06:50,000 --> 00:06:52,000
Ma Dawei.

171
00:06:56,279 --> 00:06:57,240
Manager Zhou, let me handle this.

172
00:06:57,399 --> 00:06:58,120
First thing in the morning,

173
00:06:58,120 --> 00:06:59,360
and I run into you two again.

174
00:06:59,839 --> 00:07:01,720
Yunding Tower must have terrible feng shui.

175
00:07:02,720 --> 00:07:03,360
Ma Dawei,

176
00:07:03,839 --> 00:07:06,199
this isn't a place for an upstart like you

177
00:07:06,439 --> 00:07:08,600
to wander around with some random woman.

178
00:07:11,959 --> 00:07:12,759
Who's this?

179
00:07:13,199 --> 00:07:14,759
A petty manager from Zhao Construction.

180
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:16,519
Oh, right.

181
00:07:16,720 --> 00:07:18,680
Why stick your nose into Yunding Group?

182
00:07:19,240 --> 00:07:20,240
Don't think for a second

183
00:07:20,240 --> 00:07:21,600
that making a little demolition money

184
00:07:21,759 --> 00:07:23,279
lets you leap to a higher class.

185
00:07:23,519 --> 00:07:25,399
In front of a giant like Yunding,

186
00:07:25,600 --> 00:07:26,560
you're completely out of your league.

187
00:07:30,279 --> 00:07:30,959
Lady,

188
00:07:31,079 --> 00:07:32,680
you may be getting on in years,

189
00:07:32,800 --> 00:07:34,439
but you take good care of yourself.

190
00:07:34,560 --> 00:07:36,439
Still, since Ma Dawei is keeping you,

191
00:07:36,959 --> 00:07:37,839
you should at least have him

192
00:07:37,879 --> 00:07:39,279
buy you some decent clothes.

193
00:07:39,319 --> 00:07:40,920
Coming to a big conglomerate like Yunding

194
00:07:41,079 --> 00:07:42,319
carrying an off-brand bag

195
00:07:42,519 --> 00:07:43,879
not only makes you look cheap,

196
00:07:44,279 --> 00:07:45,680
but it embarrasses Dawei, too.

197
00:07:46,120 --> 00:07:46,920
Off-brand?

198
00:07:56,040 --> 00:07:58,439
Woman to woman, I'm just warning you.

199
00:07:58,519 --> 00:07:59,600
Don't sell yourself cheap.

200
00:08:00,040 --> 00:08:01,439
If you really want to live well,

201
00:08:01,920 --> 00:08:02,680
some other day,

202
00:08:02,680 --> 00:08:04,959
drop my name, Zhou Qian, at Zhao Construction.

203
00:08:05,680 --> 00:08:07,319
You might be getting older,

204
00:08:07,360 --> 00:08:08,639
but you still have the looks.

205
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:10,439
I can set you up

206
00:08:10,439 --> 00:08:11,319
with a job at the front desk.

207
00:08:13,360 --> 00:08:14,160
Ma Dawei,

208
00:08:14,839 --> 00:08:16,680
your taste was never that great.

209
00:08:17,160 --> 00:08:18,199
With a brain like hers,

210
00:08:18,360 --> 00:08:20,000
she's only good as eye candy.

211
00:08:21,560 --> 00:08:22,800
I was young and naive back then.

212
00:08:23,480 --> 00:08:23,800
Why you...

213
00:08:23,800 --> 00:08:25,160
Cut it out, Ma Dawei.

214
00:08:25,600 --> 00:08:27,519
Drop the act.

215
00:08:27,839 --> 00:08:28,720
I admit

216
00:08:28,720 --> 00:08:31,040
you had some pull back in North City,

217
00:08:31,399 --> 00:08:33,399
getting Assistant Lin to back you up.

218
00:08:33,720 --> 00:08:35,399
But you think that little connection

219
00:08:36,320 --> 00:08:37,559
lets you strut around

220
00:08:37,559 --> 00:08:39,240
a place like Yunding Group?

221
00:08:40,000 --> 00:08:42,840
This place runs on rules and procedures!

222
00:08:43,320 --> 00:08:45,799
Assistant Lin might give you face outside,

223
00:08:46,080 --> 00:08:48,240
but under Chairman Shen's nose,

224
00:08:48,919 --> 00:08:50,840
she wouldn't dare brazenly let

225
00:08:50,840 --> 00:08:53,279
a nobody without an appointment go up!

226
00:08:53,440 --> 00:08:55,120
How do you know I don't have an appointment?

227
00:08:57,159 --> 00:08:58,440
You? An appointment?

228
00:08:59,240 --> 00:09:00,600
Give me a break, Ma Dawei.

229
00:09:01,080 --> 00:09:02,120
Big corporations have rules.

230
00:09:02,120 --> 00:09:03,279
Without an appointment,

231
00:09:03,600 --> 00:09:06,200
the front desk won't even look at you.

232
00:09:06,240 --> 00:09:06,840
Yeah, right.

233
00:09:06,840 --> 00:09:07,960
Who's here to see Chairman Shen?

234
00:09:12,480 --> 00:09:13,879
Looks like they're here to escort us.

235
00:09:18,399 --> 00:09:18,879
Hello.

236
00:09:18,919 --> 00:09:20,000
I'm from Zhao Construction.

237
00:09:20,120 --> 00:09:20,879
My name is Zhou Qian.

238
00:09:21,159 --> 00:09:22,320
President Zhao sent me to—

239
00:09:22,320 --> 00:09:23,120
Are you Mr. Ma?

240
00:09:23,639 --> 00:09:24,720
I'm so sorry to keep you waiting.

241
00:09:26,039 --> 00:09:26,600
Right this way, please.

242
00:09:27,200 --> 00:09:28,759
For me?

243
00:09:29,240 --> 00:09:30,080
Could Chairman Shen...

244
00:09:30,080 --> 00:09:32,000
have heard my voicemail

245
00:09:32,000 --> 00:09:33,879
and be lusting after my eight-pack abs?

246
00:09:37,120 --> 00:09:38,320
What's wrong, Boss Ma?

247
00:09:38,559 --> 00:09:40,240
Weren't you full of bravado just now?

248
00:09:40,440 --> 00:09:42,159
Hearing Chairman Shen is waiting upstairs,

249
00:09:42,480 --> 00:09:43,360
got your knees shaking?

250
00:09:44,279 --> 00:09:45,720
Who's shaking?

251
00:09:46,559 --> 00:09:47,399
Let's go, Boss Lady.

252
00:09:48,559 --> 00:09:49,559
Let me show you the world.

253
00:09:53,399 --> 00:09:53,960
Manager Zhou,

254
00:09:55,320 --> 00:09:56,679
not only do I lack an appointment,

255
00:09:56,960 --> 00:09:58,000
but they sent someone to escort me.

256
00:09:58,480 --> 00:09:59,799
Looks like big company rules

257
00:10:00,279 --> 00:10:01,720
aren't quite what you thought.
